This is an independent port of a fixed pySTEPS 1.21.2 configuration. It follows
and adapts the STEPS implementation, Gaussian cascades, nonparametric noise,
AR(2), incremental masks, empirical CDF matching and BPS velocity perturbations.
Copyright (c) 2019 PySteps developers. Retained license: third_party/LICENSE.pysteps.
Upstream: https://github.com/pySTEPS/pysteps

The native CPU/GPU RNG implementations adapt NumPy RandomState / RandomKit
MT19937, uniform conversion, bounded-integer rejection, polar normals and
Laplace draws. Credits include NumPy developers, Jean-Sebastien Roy, Makoto
Matsumoto, Takuji Nishimura, Richard J. Wagner, Magnus Jonsson, Isaku Wada and
Kevin Sheppard. Retained notices: third_party/LICENSE.numpy,
third_party/LICENSE.randomkit and third_party/LICENSE.numpy-random.
Upstream: https://github.com/numpy/numpy/tree/main/numpy/random

PocketFFT is vendored unmodified under BSD-3-Clause. Its authors' copyright
notices and license are in third_party/pocketfft/LICENSE.md and the header.
Exact upstream commit and hashes: third_party/pocketfft/UPSTREAM.json.

